      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "b31823cab1d40fcbb73f098749f116bdef9f25b37efe484ac913da92b59d24fb",
      "text": "This 10-day, 9-night group tour takes you to Lima, Cusco, Machu Picchu, Lake Titicaca and Isla del Sol, and La Paz. The tour includes an English-speaking guide, has fixed departures in 2027 and offers a choice of 3★, 4★ or 5★ hotels. On your free days in Cusco and Lima, you can add trips to the Sacred Valley, the Rainbow Mountains, the Ballestas Islands and the Nazca Lines.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-a8bd0e536de9",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      }
    },
    {
