      "sourceTextSha256": "a202abbd555bac501b6ec83b7b3f40495ccdb2d9e26136bb8238812f67cabafe",
      "text": "From $3268 per person based on triple occupancy in the 5★ package. 3★ package: DBL/TPL $3960. 4★ package: DBL/TPL $4278. Minimum 2 participants. We confirm 5★ rates before payment.",
